# oracle: pair_style pod (InP_param.pod + InP_coefficients.pod of examples/PACKAGES/pod/InP) on a displaced diamond InP 2x2x2 cell (64 atoms), 20 steps of nve at 300 K (velocity create as in the example)
# oracle-inputs: w128pod_InP_param.pod w128pod_InP_coeff.pod
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
# Measured with native LAMMPS (black box): max relative error over thermo (temp, pe, press, etotal) of the 5 rows 9.4e-11 (press), per-atom positions, velocities and forces scaled by max(1,|value|) 2.2e-12 (the tolerance is 1e-8).
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
boundary        p p p
variable        a equal 5.83
lattice         diamond $a
region          box block 0 2 0 2 0 2
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 box basis 5 2 basis 6 2 basis 7 2 basis 8 2
mass            1 114.76
mass            2 30.98
variable        dx atom 0.05*sin(1.3*x+0.7*y)
variable        dy atom 0.05*cos(0.9*y-0.4*z)
variable        dz atom 0.05*sin(1.1*z+0.5*x)
displace_atoms  all move v_dx v_dy v_dz units box
pair_style      pod
pair_coeff      * * w128pod_InP_param.pod w128pod_InP_coeff.pod In P
timestep        0.5e-3
velocity        all create 300.0 4928459 loop geom
fix             1 all nve
thermo_style    custom step temp pe press etotal
thermo_modify   format float %.15g norm no
thermo          5
run             20
